                "category": "details",
                "text": "CUDATOOLKIT:CUDA Toolkit",
                "title": "Product Team"
            },
            {
                "category": "summary",
                "text": "NVIDIA has released a software update for NVIDIA\u00ae nvJPEG Library within NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit to address the issues disclosed in this bulletin.<br> To protect your system, download and install this software update from the <a href=\"https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-downloads?target_os=Linux&amp;target_arch=x86_64\">CUDA Toolkit Downloads</a>&nbsp;page.",
                "title": "Summary"
            },
            {
                "category": "details",
                "text": "NVIDIA has released a software update for NVIDIA\u00ae nvJPEG Library within NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit to address the issues disclosed in this bulletin.<br> To protect your system, download and install this software update from the <a href=\"https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-downloads?target_os=Linux&amp;target_arch=x86_64\">CUDA Toolkit Downloads</a>&nbsp;page.",
                "title": "Security Update Notes"
            },
            {
                "category": "details",
                "text": "Earlier software releases of this product are also affected. If you are using an earlier release, upgrade to the latest release version.",
                "title": "Bulletin Notes"
            },
